#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the library under a new name"
msgstr "पुस्तकालयं नूतननाम्ना रक्षति"

#: commands.docbook:31
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save Symbol"
msgstr "प्रतीकं रक्षतु"

#: commands.docbook:32
#. Tag: listitem
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<simpara><action>Save the symbol being edited</action></simpara> "
"<simpara>If the symbol being edited was selected from the library, saving "
"will update that symbol. If it is a new symbol, it will be appended to the "
"library and subsequent saves will append another new symbol to the library. "
"</simpara>"
msgstr ""
"<simpara><action>सम्पादितं चिह्नं रक्षतु</action></simpara> <simpara>यदि "
"सम्पादितं चिह्नं पुस्तकालयात् चयनितम् आसीत् तर्हि रक्षणं तत् चिह्नं अद्यतनं "
"करिष्यति । यदि नूतनं चिह्नं भवति तर्हि पुस्तकालये संलग्नं भविष्यति तदनन्तरं "
"रक्षणं पुस्तकालये अन्यत् नूतनं चिह्नं योजयिष्यति । </simpara> इति"

#: commands.docbook:39
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save Symbol as New"
msgstr "Symbol इत्येतत् New इति रक्षन्तु"

#: commands.docbook:40
#. Tag: listitem
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<simpara><action>Save the symbol being edited as a new "
"symbol</action></simpara> <simpara>When a symbol is saved as new it will be "
"appended to the library regardless of it having originally been selected "
"from the library for editing. Subsequent saves will append another new "
"symbol to the library. </simpara>"
msgstr ""
"<simpara><action>सम्पादितं चिह्नं नूतनचिह्नरूपेण रक्षतु</action></simpara> "
"<simpara>यदा चिह्नं नूतनरूपेण रक्षितं भवति तदा तत् पुस्तकालयात् मूलतः "
"चयनितं न कृत्वा पुस्तकालये संलग्नं भविष्यति सम्पादनार्थम् । अनन्तरं रक्षणं "
"पुस्तकालये अन्यत् नूतनं चिह्नं योजयिष्यति । </simpara> इति"

#: commands.docbook:47
